Subject: [PATCH] ComfyUI watchdog: fail on repeated poll errors or a prompt
 ComfyUI forgot; short poll timeouts; decode at render size

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BhiEzmwUbwDK67k3BY9b4Y
